  "solution": "解：∵\\(\\angle DAB=90{}^\\circ ,\\angle ADB=25{}^\\circ\\)\n∴\\(\\angle OBA=90{}^\\circ -25{}^\\circ =65{}^\\circ\\)\n∵\\(OA=OB\\)\n∴\\(\\angle OAB=\\angle OBA=65{}^\\circ\\)\n∴\\(\\angle AOB=180{}^\\circ -65{}^\\circ -65{}^\\circ =50{}^\\circ\\)\n故选：A",
